  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: uncontrolled recursion (stack-overflow DoS) in\n     phar_get_link_source() on circular symlink chains in tar/phar archives\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-7260.patch: replace the recursive\n       phar_get_link_source() with Floyd cycle detection in ext/phar/util.c,\n       and restore the phar path separator in phar_get_link_location() so the\n       symlink walk stays idempotent\n     - CVE-2026-7260",
